// The common blue 16x2 character LCD (1602A) with a PCF8574 I2C backpack.
// Seated frame: z = 0 is the 4-pin header plastic's underside (GND, VCC, SDA, SCL on 2.54 mm).
// The backpack PCB sits at z = 5.5 mm (top at z = 7.1 mm) with two 4.7 kohm I2C pull-ups and a
// 10 kohm contrast trimmer potentiometer, and the 1602A panel mounts above it at z = 12.5 mm.
